      "content": "In the absence of crossing-over between homologous pairs of chromosomes, c = 0, f = 0, and the equilibrium frequency of gamete types is simply equal to the product of the respective allele frequencies. However, if c > 0, the equilibrium genotype frequencies are not so simple. Consider the extreme case of free",
